 ornate spear in hand."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b002:l037","ordinal":347623,"en":"Your hero Seytek stretched tall:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b002:l038","ordinal":347624,"en":"“This side of the belt,” he said,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b002:l039","ordinal":347625,"en":"“The lower edge of the lung,” he said,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b002:l040","ordinal":347626,"en":"“This is the measured spot,” he said,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l001","ordinal":347627,"en":"And staked his life upon a hair."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l002","ordinal":347628,"en":"His opponent was Sarybay;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l003","ordinal":347629,"en":"His only prayer was to God—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l004","ordinal":347630,"en":"Such was the nature of the clash."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l005","ordinal":347631,"en":"His adversary was Sarybay;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l006","ordinal":347632,"en":"To face him and test himself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l007","ordinal":347633,"en":"On the good path granted by the Creator,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l008","ordinal":347634,"en":"To surrender his precious life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l009","ordinal":347635,"en":"To stand face-to-face,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l010","ordinal":347636,"en":"In battle where blood would flow,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l011","ordinal":347637,"en":"To behold a hero’s courage,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l012","ordinal":347638,"en":"And, if God so willed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l013","ordinal":347639,"en":"To give up his dear life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l014","ordinal":347640,"en":"He made ready all his weapons,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l015","ordinal":347641,"en":"And bound on Ajybay’s sharp steel blade"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l016","ordinal":347642,"en":"Without its scabbard."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l017","ordinal":347643,"en":"Arming and preparing himself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l018","ordinal":347644,"en":"He prayed to the spirit of the noble lord"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l019","ordinal":347645,"en":"Who had passed into the other world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l020","ordinal":347646,"en":"Behold the valor inherited"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l021","ordinal":347647,"en":"From his fathers and forefathers."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0673:b003:l022","ordinal":347648,"en":"His forefather was Tügöl Khan,"}]
